    ],
    "text": "Declaring National Cinema Day",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      470.65,
      546.4,
      533.8
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me as the Minister in charge of the subject under Section 61.(2) O of National FilmsCorporation Act, No. 47 of 1971 amended by Act No. 45 of 1980, I do hereby declare 05th of April, on which the birthanniversary of Dr. Lester James Peries, veteran film maker, who marked the turning point of the cinema by his work \u201cRekava\u201dcreating an authentic expression of local cinema and releasing Sri Lankan cinema from the South Indian influence, falls as the\u2018National Cinema Day\u2019 in felicitation of the exemplary service rendered by Dr. Lester James Peries.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
